{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"8947e243-1a2a-40f8-a11c-05b3f7e5b5aa","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The app has been upgraded to the current Pollar SDK (`@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` version `0.12.0`) from npm.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Package Updates**:\n   - Upgraded `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` from `^0.10.1` to `^0.12.0` in [`package.json`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/package.json) and updated [`package-lock.json`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/package-lock.json).\n2. **API Endpoint Base URL** ([`src/pollar.ts`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/src/pollar.ts)):\n   - Updated `baseUrl` from `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1'` to `'https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz'`. In 0.12, the SDK targets the `/v3` API version by appending `/v3` to the base URL origin.\n3. **Trustline Sponsorship** ([`src/trust.ts`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/src/trust.ts)):\n   - Updated `client.setTrustline(USDC)` to omit `{ sponsored: true }`, as 0.12 sponsors trustlines by default unless opted out via `skipSponsorship: true`.\n4. **Balances Null-safety** ([`src/balances.ts`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/src/balances.ts)):\n   - Handled nullable balance values (`string | null`) introduced by 0.12 multichain support.\n5. **KYC Status Handling** ([`src/kyc.ts`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/src/kyc.ts)):\n   - Added handling for the new `'expired'` status on `KycStatus`.\n6. **Ramp Quotes API** ([`src/ramp.ts`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/src/ramp.ts)):\n   - Updated `bestTopUpRate` to use `client.quoteRamp()` with order/route-based parameters (`direction: 'ONRAMP'`, `ARS` bank transfer to Stellar `USDC`) and compute the rate (`ARS` per `USDC`) from `amountIn / amountOut` of the best route quote.\n7. **Documentation**:\n   - Recorded all changes in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-kCyfc6/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Verification\n- Ran `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run typecheck`, both of which passed with zero errors.\n","duration_seconds":773.310583,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":543212,"output_tokens":21480,"thinking_tokens":0,"c